flowchart LR
  T[transform_index] --> M[8位索引预选]
  C[chain_cursor] --> M
  B[batch_chain_index] --> M
  M --> D[唯一digit函数]
  V[value2 / checksum / LEN1] --> D
  D --> TC[TRANSFORM: checksum更新]
  D --> CS[CHAIN_SETUP: task参数锁存]
  D --> BC[batch request接受: 上下文参数锁存]
  ST[唯一executor state] -.互斥消费.-> TC
  ST -.互斥消费.-> CS
  ST -.互斥消费.-> BC
